## 4. Known caveats

- The `.venv/` directory committed to git history points at the
  pre-rename path (`MR识别/MT完备性`); contributors who clone fresh
  must recreate their own venv via:
  ```
  python3.12 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements-frozen.txt
  ```
  This is noted in `README.md` and `REPRODUCIBILITY.md`. `.venv` is
  in `.gitignore`, so the GitHub clone won't carry the broken venv.

- `data/lrca/` is empty (regenerable by `compute_lrca_v4_mp5.py`); not
  a release blocker.

- LaTeX byproducts (`*.aux`, `*.log`, `*.out`, `*.spl`) removed from
  `submission/` and `archive/submission_drafts/`. Regenerable via
  `scripts/build_ist_submission_v9.sh` (run from project root with
  `xelatex` available).

